      "role": "cite",
      "name": "habeas:coverage",
      "commentary": "Domain requires this callback even for a storage-only consumer. The\n delegation test must use only node_path; discovering edges would be\n an unwanted graph access, which this guard rejects. Traversal fixtures\n separately exercise edge discovery."
